          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "pvs1",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "SAS iTower rises 171 metres above Nanakramguda, between HITEC City and the Financial District. G + 37 floors. 6.1 million sq ft of mixed-use development across 10.36 acres. One of the four largest commercial developments in the world."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "pv2",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "pvs2",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "The typical floor plate runs 1.2 lakh sq ft, the city's largest. Every storey has a 4.1-metre floor-to-ceiling height. Full-floor BFSI tenants, Global Capability Centres, and Indian corporates — the plate is designed around all three. The digital LED façade wraps the tower in a 171-metre programmable surface, a first for any commercial project in Hyderabad."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        },
        {
          "_key": "pv3",
          "_type": "block",
          "children": [
            {
              "_key": "pvs3",
              "_type": "span",
              "marks": [],
              "text": "Designed by Aedas. Targeting LEED Gold and WELL Silver certification."
            }
          ],
          "markDefs": [],
          "style": "normal"
        }
      ],
